		Description		"Performs analog filtering, signal conditioning and sampling. A single signal is the input, a buffer wi"
		"th the signal samples is the output. The options include analog filter enable/disable switch, type, order and cut-of"
		"f frequency of the analog filter, conditioning gain, sampling frequency, number of bits, the length of the buffer."
		Help			"web(['file:///' which('dab.html')]);"
